*.pyc
# Everything the daemon writes at runtime. A directory, not a list of
# paths: enumerating them meant a new one (notes/) was tracked by
# default, and an operator's private repo notes were committed.
# That includes jobs/: one workspace per job chain (a git worktree plus the
# chain's omp session directory), released and aged out by the daemon's
# workspace sweep.
hunter/data/
__pycache__/
hunter/ui/
